 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Subfunctors",
 "statement": "Let $F:(\\mathit{Sch})^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\textit{Sets}$ be a functor. A\n*subfunctor* $H\\subseteq F$ is an assignment\n$T\\mapsto H(T)\\subseteq F(T)$ such that the maps $F(f):F(T)\\to F(T')$\nsend $H(T)$ into $H(T')$ for all morphisms $f:T'\\to T$ (Schemes,\nDefinition 26.15.3, Tag\n[01JI](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01JI)).",
 "source": {
